    (tendsto_div_two_mul_one_add_sq _ tendsto_abs_atTop_atTop).add
      ((tendsto_arctan_atTop.mono_right nhdsWithin_le_nhds).div_const 2)
  rw [integral_of_hasDerivAt_of_tendsto hasDerivAt_antideriv_inv_one_add_sq_sq
